          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": true,
            "title": "Setting Up",
            "text": "<p><strong>Assembly Preparation</strong><br/><br/>1. Carefully remove all contents from the product packaging.<br/><br/>2. Ensure you have all the accessories and tool(s) needed for assembly and operation. This also includes suitable personal protective equipment.<br/><br/><strong>Assembling the Lower Handles</strong><br/><br/>1. Insert the two lower handles into the motor cover and secure them with the two Phillips screws.<br/><br/><strong>Assembling the Centre and Upper Handle.</strong><br/><br/>1. Secure the centre handle to the lower handles with the bolts and wing knobs. Ensure the bolt and wing knob are assembled in the correct method.<br/><br/>2. Secure the upper handle to centre handle with the bolts and wing knobs. Ensure the bolt and wing knob are assembled in the correct method.<br/><br/>3. Use the two cable clips to attach the power cable to the handle frame.<br/><br/>NOTE: During assembly, ensure that the power cable is not squeezed and that it has sufficient play<br/><br/><strong>Mounting and Emptying the Collection Bag</strong><br/><br/>The collection bag must be assembled before it is mounted on the machine.<br/><br/>1. Assemble the collection bag frame by connecting the two parts.<br/><br/>2. Pull the collecting bag over the bag frame ensuring the collection bag handle feeds through the hole in the top of the fabric collection bag.<br/><br/>3. Pull the plastic clips over the collection bag frame. Mounting the collection bag on the machine:<br/><br/>4. Lift the safety guard.<br/><br/>5. Push the pins on the collection bag rods into the socket in the motor cover.<br/><br/>6. Release the safety guard so that it holds the collection bag in its position.<br/><br/><strong>Removing and emptying the collection bag:</strong><br/><br/>1. Lift the safety guard and take out the collection bag.<br/><br/>NOTE: The rear wheels are swivel-hinged to stabilise the appliance when the bag is full.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "black",
            "button_1_text": "Shop now",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "link",
            "button_2_text": "Go to support page",
            "button_2_url": "",
            "product_specifications": "",
            "html": "",
            "collection": "",
            "collection_products_per_page": 8,
            "products": [],
